/target/
/gen/
# tauri-build writes the allow-*/deny-* permissions for the commands build.rs
# lists, on every build. Only that generated subtree is ignored: tauri-build
# also *reads* hand-written permission definitions from the whole permissions/
# directory, and ignoring all of it would leave an author's file untracked with
# no git status output to say so.
/permissions/autogenerated/
